      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be nice to be able to call or message VRChat friends who are in-game and don't have Discord, in case I'm trying to figure out what trouble they're having joining a lobby, or want to apologize to and coordinate with Quest users I accidentally left behind. I imagine it would be based on the camera, but at a lower resolution, and ideally, other people (who are close enough?) would be able to see and hear the call too, with call audio anchored to the phone.",
